{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "179", "x": 0.8959551137550246, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03778813484861114, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: Yes, absolutely. I'm not sure there's much you can do about children", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.8261678386806761, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "with dyspraxia writing very slowly; it's more important to focus on accuracy and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1436641300790535, "w": 0.8259463847804577, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "as they get more confident I think they eventually speed up.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.16398487055300617, "w": 0.6177942771185936, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: One quite simple thing you can do is to use grid paper so they write", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19424346276951368, "w": 0.8259875998118872, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "each letter in a box and that trains them to space the letters correctly.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21471252375881908, "w": 0.7230150220587565, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: Indeed, that's more important for legibility than trying to get them to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2449711914181116, "w": 0.826480949889596, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "write in a straight line. For some children, it might be better to teach them to write", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.8262731318082336, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on a laptop rather than by hand, like children with dyslexia. They often really", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.28579803528881537, "w": 0.8259901629357324, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "struggle with handwriting, and some just give up.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.306118775762768, "w": 0.5080885780742389, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: Yeah, it's not as frustrating for them if they get things wrong. On a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3363774245613643, "w": 0.8260645960521946, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "keyboard, they can be more willing to have a go. But I read that developing fluency", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.356698089592532, "w": 0.8263382351538997, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "isn't any faster.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.37716722602462244, "w": 0.16654115049197113, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: That's right. Did you read that article on the benefits of teaching print", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40742581824112994, "w": 0.8267731460079397, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "rather than cursive handwriting where the letters are joined up?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4277465587150826, "w": 0.657100857795531, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: Yes. Well, in the past, cursive writing was certainly considered more", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.45800515093159017, "w": 0.8260905348655072, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "stylish and educated, but not anymore. Teachers' attitudes have changed because", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.47835063663902994, "w": 0.8261859855974996, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "it's been proved that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49881969762833533, "w": 0.2192019139768476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cursive is more difficult to learn, especially for children with learning difficulties", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5290782898448428, "w": 0.825909475797088, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "who find joining up letters is really challenging.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5493990303187956, "w": 0.4899470950733376, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: I agree. I was always worried that my poor handwriting affected my", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5796576602566956, "w": 0.8261739901779044, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "exam results. And now research shows that I was right to worry. I'm sure a lot of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.600126721246001, "w": 0.8263254195346741, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "students think it's unfair that they're being judged on their handwriting, not just", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6204474994413461, "w": 0.8258813839597454, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "their knowledge.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6407681644725138, "w": 0.18044963446265594, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: Marks are definitely affected if examiners can't read the script.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6710638745392521, "w": 0.8267449516456434, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "That's why it's always been so important to teach children to write legibly. Do you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6915329355285574, "w": 0.8265062735531858, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "think the role of handwriting will change in the future?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7118536760025101, "w": 0.5625130783394198, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: I can't see that changing much. Touch typing still isn't taught in most", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7421122682190177, "w": 0.8260299426178086, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "schools, which is a shame, but maybe that won't be necessary in the future", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.762581404651108, "w": 0.82671521940904, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "because people will also be able to write by hand on digital devices. Anyway,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7829020696822757, "w": 0.826033428466238, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "teachers understand the value of handwriting. It's a basic life skill.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8032228855990134, "w": 0.6814911342058823, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 2: True. However, the fact is that people are writing by hand less and less", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.833481477815521, "w": 0.8263307508322719, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "and relying on digital devices. That does cause some problems.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8539505388048263, "w": 0.6490379878534587, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Student 1: You mean like note-taking? There are lots of apps for that.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.884233876254821, "w": 0.711726973382369, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}